---
title: Checkout
config:
  theme: forest
  layout: elk
---
%%{init: {"theme": "forest"}}%%
flowchart LR
    accTitle: Checkout flow
    accDescr: How an order moves from the cart to a confirmed payment, with retries and a fallback provider.

    %% comments are ignored
    Cart([Cart]) --> Validate{Valid order?}
    Validate -- no --> Fix[/Fix the order/]
    Fix -.-> Cart
    Validate -- yes --> Pay

    subgraph Payments [Payment service]
        direction TB
        Pay[[Charge card]] ==> Gateway[(Payment gateway)]
        Gateway -->|declined| Retry((Retry))
        Retry --> Pay
        subgraph Fallback [Fallback provider]
            Alt{{"Second provider (EU)"}}
        end
        Gateway -.->|timeout| Alt
    end

    Gateway -->|approved| Done>Order confirmed]
    Alt --> Done
    Done <--> Notify["Email & push — café ☕"]
    Payments --> Audit[(Audit log)]

    classDef warn fill:#f96,stroke:#333
    class Retry warn
    style Done stroke-width:4px
    click Done "https://example.com" "ignored by Koru"
